    "Muhammad, the Qur'an, and the astonishing Arab conquests from Spain to Persia; Pirenne's claim that without Muhammad there would have been no Charlemagne. Then the Frankish king who conquered the Saxons, was crowned emperor on Christmas Day 800, governed by counts and envoys, and sponsored a revival of learning.",
